<title>JAPAN: Sankyo to start sales of diabetes drug on March 4.</title>
<headline>Sankyo to start sales of diabetes drug on March 4.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sankyo Co Ltd said on Monday that it would start selling its diabetes drug Noscal in Japan on March 4.</p>
</text>
